{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"macro","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DebugDescription","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Macro","modules":[{"name":"Standard Library"}],"externalID":"s:s16DebugDescriptionyycfm","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","deprecated":false}],"symbolKind":"macro","role":"symbol","title":"DebugDescription()"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomReflectable","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomLeafReflectable","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/PlaygroundQuickLook"],"title":"Customizing Your Type’s Reflection","anchor":"Customizing-Your-Types-Reflection"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/debugdescription()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Converts description definitions to a debugger Type Summary."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@attached"},{"kind":"text","text":"(member) "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@attached"},{"kind":"text","text":"(memberAttribute) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DebugDescription"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This macro converts compatible description implementations written in Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to an LLDB format known as a Type Summary. A Type Summary is LLDB’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equivalent to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":", with the distinction that it does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"execute code inside the debugged process. By avoiding code execution,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"descriptions can be produced faster, without potential side effects, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown in situations where code execution is not performed, such as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"variable list of an IDE."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Consider this an example. This "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Team"},{"type":"text","text":" struct has a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"summarizes some key details, such as the team’s name. The debugger only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes this string on demand - typically via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"po"},{"type":"text","text":" command. By applying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DebugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" macro, a matching Type Summary is constructed. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allows the user to show a string like “Rams [11-2]”, without executing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":". This improves the usability, performance, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reliability of the debugging experience."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@DebugDescription","struct Team: CustomDebugStringConvertible {","   var name: String","   var wins, losses: Int","","   var debugDescription: String {","       \"\\(name) [\\(wins)-\\(losses)]\"","   }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DebugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" macro supports both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as well as a third option: a property named "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lldbDescription"},{"type":"text","text":". The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two are implemented when conforming to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomDebugStringConvertible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomStringConvertible"},{"type":"text","text":" protocols. The additional "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lldbDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property is useful when both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implemented, but don’t meet the requirements of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DebugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"macro. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lldbDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is implemented, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DebugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" choose it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":". Likewise, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"debugDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preferred over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Description-Requirements","level":3,"text":"Description Requirements","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The description implementation has the following requirements:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The body of the description implementation must be a single string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"expression. String concatenation is not supported, use string interpolation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"String interpolation can reference stored properties only, functions calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and other arbitrary computation are not supported. Of note, conditional","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"logic and computed properties are not supported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Overloaded string interpolation cannot be used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/DebugDescription()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift"]]},"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A type that supplies a custom description for playground logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/customplaygrounddisplayconvertible","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomPlaygroundDisplayConvertible"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/CustomReflectable":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"CustomReflectable","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/customreflectable","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomReflectable"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomReflectable","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CustomReflectable","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that explicitly supplies its own mirror."}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","role":"collection","title":"Standard Library","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Standard Library","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift","abstract":[{"text":"Browse the essential types provided by Swift’s standard library.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/CustomLeafReflectable":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CustomLeafReflectable","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/customleafreflectable","title":"CustomLeafReflectable","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CustomLeafReflectable","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CustomLeafReflectable"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that explicitly supplies its own mirror, but whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"descendant classes are not represented in the mirror unless they","type":"text"},{"type":"text",